  "Content": "Purpose: This policy sets out the rules on training budget at Vandenberg Logistics NV.\n\nPolicy: Each employee has a training budget of EUR 1,500 per calendar year.\n\nConditions: Unused budget does not roll over. Requests are approved through the learning portal.\n\nValidity: Version 3.0, effective 2025-01-01. Supersedes version 1.2 (2022). Approved by the Management Committee.",
